Third-party notices
===================

The integer steps in src/cts/sensors/Bme280Comp.h (the temperature, pressure,
and humidity arithmetic in bme280Compensate) were copied from
Adafruit_BME280.cpp in the Adafruit BME280 Library, commit
ef712e95147de926b4545e379f6296ad271529b5 (library version 2.3.0), which is
BSD licensed.

This copy is not a Bosch SensorAPI port. It is the Adafruit 2.3.0 integer
sequence, not a datasheet certificate. Local edits around that copy: the
12-bit dig_H4 and dig_H5 fields are assembled in unsigned arithmetic and
sign-extended, and a calibration with dig_P1==0 does not run the pressure
division and is not published as 0 Pa.

